<title>POLAND: Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight stocks rose, five fell and five were flat in 12.5-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Friday.</p>
<p>The remaining three stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose in a 24.8-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
